flowchart TB
  U[Internet users] --> ALB[Internet-facing ALB]
  subgraph VPC[ VPC across two Availability Zones ]
    subgraph AZ1[Availability Zone A]
      PUB1[Public subnet A: ALB / NAT]
      APP1[Private subnet A: ASG app instance]
      DB1[Database subnet A]
    end
    subgraph AZ2[Availability Zone B]
      PUB2[Public subnet B: ALB / NAT]
      APP2[Private subnet B: ASG app instance]
      DB2[Database subnet B]
    end
    ALB --> APP1
    ALB --> APP2
    APP1 --> RDS[(RDS MySQL Multi-AZ)]
    APP2 --> RDS
    APP1 --> S3[(Private S3 assets bucket)]
    APP2 --> S3
    APP1 --> NAT[NAT Gateway(s)]
    APP2 --> NAT
    NAT --> IGW[Internet Gateway]
    PUB1 --> IGW
    PUB2 --> IGW
  end
